Siemens V72 two-EF804S audio circuit - drawing S843, after serial 1000
* The 1u primary series cap is retained. Heater and mains are represented
* by a quiet B+ feed. Transformer parasitics and EF804S curves are estimated.
.param FREQ=1000 DRIVE=1m RGC=4000 TERM=1 SOURCE=200 LOAD=300
Vsig source 0 AC 1 SIN(0 {DRIVE} {FREQ})
Rsource source mic {SOURCE}
C30 mic pri 1u
XCT1 pri 0 g1 0 COIL n=10 lp=30 rp=105 rs=1050 k=.999998 cw=80p
Einput in 0 g1 0 1
R11 g1 0 400k
X41 a1 g1 s1 k1 EF804S
R12 k1 0 1.25k
R19 k1 k2 50k
R20 k1 feedback {RGC}
R18 feedback a2 80k
C39 k1 a2 50p
C40 k1 a2 2p
R13 feed platefeed 50k
R16 platefeed a1 200k
R15 platefeed s1 800k
C34 platefeed 0 8u
R14 s1 0 800k
C31 s1 0 50n
C32 a1 g2 25n
R21 g2 0 3Meg
X42 a2 g2 s2 k2 EF804S
R22 k2 0 500
R23 s2 k2 200k
R24 s2 feed 30k
C35 feed 0 8u
Rchoke feed choke 2.4k
Lck choke a2 120
Cchoke feed a2 95p
C33 a2 outPri 2u
XCT2 outPri 0 native 0 COIL n=.143 lp=160 rp=650 rs=35 k=.9999 cw=340p
Rload native 0 {LOAD}
Eout out 0 native 0 .8
Vrect unregulated 0 300
R26 unregulated supplyA 2.5k
R27 supplyA supplyB 2.5k
R25 supplyB feed 2k
C36 unregulated 0 8u
C37 supplyA 0 8u
C38 supplyB 0 8u

* Pentode current law around published EF804S nominal operating points.
.subckt EF804S a g s k
Bdrive drive 0 V={.19*log(1+exp(min(55,(V(g,k)+V(s,k)/34.9-.35)/.19)))}
Bplate a k I={.00152*pow(max(V(drive),1e-8),1.44)*(2/3.14159265)*atan(max(V(a,k),0)/22)*(1+max(V(a,k),0)/4200)}
Bscreen s k I={.00021*pow(max(V(drive),1e-8),1.44)}
Dgrid g k GRID
Rgrid g k 220Meg
Cga g a .065p
Cgk g k 3.5p
Cak a k 4.0p
.model GRID D(IS=1e-12 N=1.65)
.ends EF804S

.subckt COIL ip im op om params: n=2 lp=10 rp=20 rs=100 k=.9999 cw=100p
Rprimary ip p {rp}
Lprimary p im {lp}
Lsecondary s om {lp*n*n}
Kwind Lprimary Lsecondary {k}
Rsecondary s op {rs}
Cwind op om {cw}
.ends COIL
.end
